# Copy to .env for local development: cp .env.template .env
# Keep this file in sync with what the code actually reads (see
# env_file_usage in AgentSoul).

# MCP credentials referenced by .mcp.json (optional locally; required for the
# GitHub / Context7 MCP servers to authenticate):
# GITHUB_MCP_TOKEN=
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=

# Tavily Benchmark app (see specs/tavily-benchmark-app.md) -----------------
#
# Required only for `just record-fixtures` (the one-off script that
# regenerates api/fixtures/**). The served app always replays those
# checked-in fixtures — no env vars are needed to run `just docker-run`.
#
TAVILY_API_KEY=
#
# Optional, local-only: set to any value to make Table 1's Tavily services
# (raw tool call, MCP, extract) call the real Tavily API instead of
# replaying fixtures.
# TAVILY_LIVE=
#
# There is NO ANTHROPIC_API_KEY here, unusually for this repo — this org's
# policy disables issuing one. The Claude Web Search column's fixtures are
# instead recorded via the Claude Code CLI's own login: run `claude /login`
# on the machine that runs `just record-fixtures`, once. See
# specs/tavily-benchmark-app.md §4/§7/§14 for the full rationale.

# TinyFish (search/fetch comparison) — required for `just record-fixtures`
# alongside TAVILY_API_KEY, plus the `tinyfish` CLI on PATH (npm i -g
# @tiny-fish/cli). `--tinyfish-only` records just the TinyFish legs.
# TINYFISH_API_KEY=
